    <string name="dialog_av1_software_message">Anaghị akwado ngbanwe Hardware AV1 na ngwaọrụ a.\n\nA ga-eme ndekọ site na iji Software AV1 (ntụgharị CPU). Nke a nwere ike ime ka ojiji CPU mụbaa, oriri batrị dị elu, yana etiti nwere ike ịdaba na mkpebi dị elu.</string>
